# Crontab block for the podcast pipeline. Times are the machine's local time (cron uses the system time zone).
# Install by adding these lines to `crontab -e`; adjust the path if the project lives elsewhere.
# The topic names must match `name:` in config.yaml exactly.
#
# MAILTO=you@example.org      # optional: cron mails any output, i.e. the one-line failure messages (needs a working local mail setup)

# Episodes, 01:00: Monday / Wednesday / Thursday
0 1 * * 1  /home/francesco/workspace/auto_scientific_podcast/deploy/run_topic.sh "MSK MRI"
0 1 * * 3  /home/francesco/workspace/auto_scientific_podcast/deploy/run_topic.sh "Segmentation MRI"
0 1 * * 4  /home/francesco/workspace/auto_scientific_podcast/deploy/run_topic.sh "AI Recon MRI"

# NotebookLM login keepalive, every 20 minutes
*/20 * * * *  /home/francesco/workspace/auto_scientific_podcast/deploy/keepalive.sh
